Next step — Kubernetes Service

Pods have internal IPs that can change. A Service gives them one stable address and load-balances requests between them.

IN Production we will use:

In production AKS, the normal architecture is:

Internet
   ↓
Azure Load Balancer / Application Gateway
   ↓
Ingress Controller
   ↓
ClusterIP Service
   ↓
Pods

