we faced some tls issue so needed to open a file and do modification. it should be keept in the metric-server config:

Set Notepad as the Kubernetes editor:

$env:KUBE_EDITOR = "notepad"

Open the Deployment:

kubectl edit deployment metrics-server -n kube-system

Notepad will open a YAML file. Find:

containers:
- args:

Under the existing arguments, add:

  - --kubelet-insecure-tls

You can verify it anytime:
kubectl get deployment metrics-server -n kube-system `
  -o jsonpath="{.spec.template.spec.containers[0].args}"

